# 本地手工测试（VS Code REST Client / IDEA HTTP Client）
# 撮合数据来自 data/{sse,szse}/*.csv：SSE 账户 10001-10010、SZSE 账户 20001-20010

### SSE 买入（异步受理，立即返回 pending=true）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "orderId": "10002",
    "market": "sse",
    "userId": 10001,
    "action": "BID",
    "reservePrice": 50.0,
    "orderType": "GTC",
    "price": 50.0,
    "size": 3,
    "symbol": 600000
}

### SZSE 卖出（同步等待撮合确认，execType: 0=受理 8=拒绝）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "orderId": "20002",
    "market": "szse",
    "userId": 20001,
    "action": "ASK",
    "orderType": "GTC",
    "price": 12.5,
    "size": 10,
    "symbol": 1,
    "waitTimeoutMs": 3000
}

### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/health
